# Factor: Factor documentation, Syntax (parsing words, comments, literals); requirements/languages/factor.md
name     factor

keyword  USING: USE: IN: TUPLE: SYMBOL: SYMBOLS: CONSTANT: M: GENERIC: GENERIC# MACRO: MEMO:
keyword  PRIVATE> <PRIVATE QUALIFIED: FROM: if when unless cond case each map reduce times
builtin  t f dup drop swap over rot nip pick keep bi tri call curry print

ident-part     -:?!<>*/=+#
line-comment   !
string   " "  : escapes
operators  [](){}:;
